      "statement": "The walker is an ignore-crate WalkBuilder rooted at the first search path, with hidden-file, .fdignore, VCS-ignore, parent-ignore, symlink, same-filesystem, depth, and thread settings taken from Config; additional search paths are added to the same walk.",
